title: >-
  SentiAzNet: A Leakage-Audited, Multi-Domain Azerbaijani Sentiment
  Benchmark and a Controlled Comparison of Encoders, Adapted LLMs, and
  Cross-Lingual Transfer
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark, please cite the article below.
