abstract: >-
  A leakage-audited, multi-domain sentiment benchmark for Azerbaijani:
  271,278 user comments across five domains, with a 10,000-item gold
  partition whose 3,000-item test set is fully triple-annotated and
  adjudicated. The release provides identifiers, labels, per-annotator
  records, the full split, regeneration tooling, the experimental
  pipeline, the leakage-audit code, and the recorded results of more
  than six hundred training runs.
